§§ `s 377B - sexual penetration with living animal`

-- src:9024 | Sexual penetration with living animal
-- src:9026 | 377B.—(1) Any person (A) who —
-- src:9028 | (a) penetrates, with A’s penis, the vagina, anus or any orifice of an animal; or
-- src:9030 | (b) causes or permits A’s vagina, anus or mouth, as the case may be, to be
-- src:9031 | penetrated by the penis of an animal,
-- src:9033 | shall be guilty of an offence.
-- src:9035 | (2) A person who is guilty of an offence under subsection (1) shall be punished with
-- src:9036 | imprisonment for a term which may extend to 2 years, or with fine, or with both.
-- src:9038 | (3) Any person (A) who —
-- src:9040 | (a) causes any man (B) to penetrate, with B’s penis, the vagina, anus or any
-- src:9041 | orifice of an animal; or
-- src:9043 | (b) causes the vagina, anus or mouth, as the case may be, of another person (B)
-- src:9044 | to be penetrated with the penis of an animal,
-- src:9046 | shall be guilty of an offence if B did not consent to the penetration.
-- src:9048 | (4) A person who is guilty of an offence under subsection (3) shall be punished with
-- src:9049 | imprisonment for a term which may extend to 20 years, and shall also be liable to fine or
-- src:9050 | to caning.
@ref Penal Code 1871 s 377B (src:9024-9050)
DECLARE `Animal Penetration Facts` HAS
    particulars IS A Particulars @desc Who is charged, and when and where the offence was committed
    victim IS A STRING @desc A description of the animal, or the name of the person (B) caused to penetrate or be penetrated, as it is to appear in the charge
    `victim described as` IS A STRING @desc How the charge describes that person, after the name; leave blank if not needed
    `the manner` IS A STRING @desc What the accused did, as it is to read after "to wit," - for example "by penetrating the vagina of a dog with your penis"
    `the creature is an animal within section 47` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the creature an "animal" - any living creature other than a human being (s 47)? See `s 47 the creature is an animal`
    `A penetrates, with A's penis, the vagina, anus or any orifice of an animal` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did A do this? (s 377B(1)(a))
    `A causes or permits A's vagina, anus or mouth to be penetrated by the penis of an animal` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did A do this? (s 377B(1)(b))
    `A causes any man (B) to penetrate, with B's penis, the vagina, anus or any orifice of an animal` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did A do this? (s 377B(3)(a))
    `A causes the vagina, anus or mouth of another person (B) to be penetrated with the penis of an animal` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did A do this? (s 377B(3)(b))
    `B did not consent to the penetration` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did B NOT consent to the penetration? (s 377B(3))

@ref Penal Code 1871 s 377B (src:9026-9033)
