DECIDE `penetrates or is penetrated by a living animal within section 377B(1)` f IF
        f's `the creature is an animal within section 47`
   ...  "(a) penetrates, with A's penis, the vagina, anus or any orifice of an animal; or (b) causes or permits A's vagina, anus or mouth, as the case may be, to be penetrated by the penis of an animal"
   ...    (f's `A penetrates, with A's penis, the vagina, anus or any orifice of an animal` OR f's `A causes or permits A's vagina, anus or mouth to be penetrated by the penis of an animal`)

